---
// The mount root (equicityseo.com/blueprint) is not a client page. Clients always get their own link.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive" />
    <title>Equicity Blueprint</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #fff; color: #0b0c0f; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
      main { max-width: 420px; padding: 24px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
      h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      p { margin: 0; color: #5b6168; line-height: 26px; }
      a { color: #1d5fd1; font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>This is a private client tool.</h1>
      <p>If Evan sent you a link to your blueprint, open that link and enter the code he sent with it.</p>
      <p><a href="https://equicityseo.com/">Go to equicityseo.com</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
